    PredSatLaws predSat tm →
    result2.qualType = ⟨etyp2, p2, pred2⟩ →
    result1.qualType.etyp = ETyp.arrow st1 st2 p tcls →
    Regime.monotoneStep (ctxAfter ctx result2).regime result1.regime' →
